{"text": "Dukakis announces for governor\nLucas, Peter\n\nBoston Globe (1960-1985); Oct 2, 1973; ProQuest Historical Newspapers: The Boston Globe\n\npel\n\nDukakis announces for governor\n\nBy Peter Lucas\nGlobe Staft\n\nFormer state Rep. Michael S, Du-\nkakis, 39, of Brookline yesterday an-\nnounced his candidacy for the Dem-\nocratic nomination for governor,\n\nDukakis, the unsuccessful candi-\ndate for lieutenant governor in 1970,\nin making his announcement, said he\nwill run a campaign that will \u201cgo far\nbeyond what the law requires in\nopening our campaign accounts to\nthe public,\u201d\n\nDukakis, who gave up the House\nseat he held eight years to run on a\nticket headed by Boston Mayor\nKevin H. White for governor three\nyears ago, said that before the end of\nthe month he would release:\n\n\u2014 A complete list of all contribu-\ntions received to date, including\nnames and addresses of contributors\nand amounts contributed,\n\nDUKAKIS, Page 6\n\nReproduced with permission of the copyright owner. Further reproduction prohibited without permission.",
